	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quod tanto tempore literis tuis ad me novissimis nihil responderim, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>caussam ex <persName ref="p8442">Simlero</persName> tuo vel etiam meo nunc cognosces.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Igitur, tametsi <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>te pridem rescivisse puto, quae ex me scire cupiebas, ac longe fortasse <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>etiam certiora, quam ego tibi scribere queam, scribam tamen, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quę hactenus scire potui, idque <placeName ref="l822">Germanice</placeName>; nam hoc te velle ex <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>literis tuis cognovi.<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>"</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="de">Es ist mir von meins g[nädigen] hern hof geschriben worden, wie ain <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>junger vom adel, mit nammen <persName ref="p7412">Bat Wilhelm von Bonstetten</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>von <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>, so ain zeyt lang an gemelten meins g[nädigen] <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>h[ern] hof gewesen, alda von menigklichem lieb und werd ge<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>halten, des vorndrigen jars mit grafe <persName ref="p20960">Bastian von Helffenstein</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>in <placeName ref="l869">Sybenbirgen</placeName> zogen sey, und wie er dadennen widerum mit <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>andern frisch und gesund ins land <placeName ref="l572">Wirttemberg</placeName> khummen, hab er <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>sich nit weyter an den hof wellen begeben, sonder sey <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mit etlichen margraf <persName ref="p8616">Albrechten von Branden<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>burg</persName> zuͦgezogen; da sage man, er sey umbkhummen."</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Haec, quoniam incerta sunt, non destiti porro investigare; itaque <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>accepi, quosdam in oppido ducatus huius esse, cui nomen <placeName ref="l1913">Schorndorf</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>qui <persName ref="p7412">Beato</persName> comites in militiam posteriorem fuerint.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Ad quos <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>scripsi me ea de re bona fide certiorem scripto meis impensis <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>facerent.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Id simulatque accepero (expe[c]to autem in dies), <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ad te primo quoque et nuncio et tempore mittam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Interim vale, vir <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>doctissime atque optime, sitque officium <persName ref="p8113">Volmarii</persName> tibi cordi semper.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><placeName ref="l512">Tubinge</placeName> sexto decimo calendas februarii anno etc 59.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Tui nominis <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>studiosissimus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p8113">Melchior Volmarius <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Rufus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eximia doctrina, pietate et dignitate viro <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, d. et amico honorando suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
